			<div class="content" id="post-content-4502178">
									

<p>Hello! This collaborative effort was brought to you by myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snuggly-face" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5599959); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5599959&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581797551" alt="snuggly face" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5599959)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snuggly-face" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5599959); return false;">snuggly face</a></span>. It took a long time, but we finally go there.</p>
<p>There were a lot of stressors and roadblocks along the way- snuggly's going off to the military, I have school, yada yada- so I'm absolutely thrilled that we managed to get this done and posted as soon as we did.</p>
<p>Thanks to our critters, especially <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/torcsandantlers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5963598); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5963598&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581797551" alt="torcsandantlers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5963598)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/torcsandantlers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5963598); return false;">torcsandantlers</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1581797551" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;">cybersqyd</a></span>, who were both massive helps.</p>
<p>I hope you enjoy reading, and I hope this article is successful. This would be snuggly's second article, and my first.</p>

